{"stories":{"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10013000":{"episode":"ep5","category":"npcpanel_menu","story_id":"10013000","sequence_index":13,"plot_row_index":"5640","order_index":"5640","numeric_id":"10013000","physical_section":"ep5","plot_id":"10013000","dialogue_kind":"Menu","metadata_source":"story_metadata_generated_context","metadata_sources":["story_metadata_context"],"summary":"","context_summary_source_cn":"即使是在雅库伯尔的土地上，呼临城的麦种也无法生长。或许真的只有弑神，才能平息呼临和雅库伯尔之间的战争。","context_summary_i18n":{"cn":"即使是在雅库伯尔的土地上，呼临城的麦种也无法生长。或许真的只有弑神，才能平息呼临和雅库伯尔之间的战争。","en":"Even here in Wildborn land, the seeds from Halia refuse to sprout. Maybe it really will take the death of a god to end this war between the two lands.","jp":"ヤクボルの土地でも、小麦が成長することはなかった。もしかしたら神を葬る以外に、ホーリンとヤクボルの戦争を止める術はないのかもしれない。","kr":"아쿠보르의 땅에서도 보칼리스의 밀 씨앗은 자라나지 않았다. 어쩌면 정말로 신을 심판하는 것만이 보칼리스와 아쿠보르의 전쟁을 끝낼 수 있는 방법일지도 모른다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25277,"context_summary_record_indices":[25277],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10009070","context_summary_direction":"next_plot_summary","context_summary_distance":4,"episode_title_source_cn":"血月将至","episode_title_i18n":{"cn":"血月将至","en":"Thorns of Devotion","jp":"紅き月の刻","kr":"붉은 달의 예언"},"episode_title_status":{"cn":"exact_unique","en":"exact_unique","jp":"exact_unique","kr":"exact_unique"},"episode_title_evidence":{"source":"Config/Season.luae","table_key":"105","season_type":"105","entry_condition":"ed.ConditionX.IsUserInEp(\"Ep05\")","opening_quest":"15010101","episode":"ep5","status":"explicit_episode_and_opening_quest"},"asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10013000","asset_path":"ep5/npcpanel_menu/NodeCanvas__DialogueTree__ep5__npcpanel_menu_10013000.decoded.json","graph":"stories/ep5/npcpanel_menu/10013000.graph.json","locales":{"cn":"locales/cn/ep5/npcpanel_menu/1001300